flowchart TD
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities<br/>Discrete integers {1-10}"]
Controller["**MOO Controller**<br/>run_nsga2_optimization<br/>configures problem algorithm termination"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes n_var - 6<br/>n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>Method _evaluate X builds tasks"]
NSGA2Algo["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Attributes pop_size n_gen sampling crossover mutation<br/>Runs minimize on problem"]
ProcessPool["**Process Pool**<br/>Parallel execution across n cores<br/>maps tasks to evaluator workers"]
EvaluatorWorker["**Evaluator Worker**<br/>Function evaluate_single_individual<br/>Validates caps runs replications aggregates results"]
SimulationModel["**Production Simulation**<br/>Function run_simulation seed caps warmup measure_until<br/>Returns throughput wip and per machine energy"]
DelayBuffer["**DelayBuffer**<br/>Attributes cap delay store tokens in_transit<br/>Methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
Machine["**Machine**<br/>Attributes process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>Methods run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
ResultCollector["**Result Collector**<br/>Aggregates replications<br/>Computes avg_wip avg_throughput<br/>Produces objectives F and constraints G"]
CSVExporter["**Export History**<br/>export_history_to_csv<br/>Saves feasible solutions per generation to CSV in results directory"]

DecisionVars --> BufferProblem
Controller --> BufferProblem
Controller --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> ProcessPool
ProcessPool --> EvaluatorWorker
EvaluatorWorker --> SimulationModel
SimulationModel --> DelayBuffer
SimulationModel --> Machine
EvaluatorWorker --> ResultCollector
ResultCollector --> BufferProblem
NSGA2Algo --> CSVExporter
Controller --> CSVExporter